rking on this issue, but still thanks a lot for all the suggestions and advises lulzfish, God Bless You!!  <img class="smilies" src="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/images/smilies/icon_lol.gif" width="15" height="15" alt=":lol:" title="Laughing">  <br><br>If I got any further progress I'll come up and post a solution <img class="smilies" src="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/images/smilies/icon_biggrin.gif" width="15" height="15" alt=":D" title="Very Happy"> <br>If you come up with any other ideas please don't hesitate to share it, Thanks! <img class="smilies" src="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/images/smilies/icon_biggrin.gif" width="15" height="15" alt=":D" title="Very Happy"><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=7598">KeKe</a> — Wed Jan 05, 2011 2:19 pm</p><hr />
